@host = http://localhost:5080
@apiKey = change-me

### Supported corridors and fee tiers
GET {{host}}/corridors

### Latest rates
GET {{host}}/rates/

### Quote: customer sends 250 KWD
POST {{host}}/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "KWD", "target": "INR", "amount": 250, "mode": "Send" }

### Quote: recipient must get exactly 100,000 INR
POST {{host}}/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "KWD", "target": "INR", "amount": 100000, "mode": "Receive" }

### Create a transfer (paste a quote id)
POST {{host}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 6c1d2f0e-demo-0001

{
  "quoteId": "<quote-id>",
  "sender":    { "fullName": "Ahmed Ali",  "country": "KW" },
  "recipient": { "fullName": "Priya Nair", "country": "IN", "accountNumber": "50100012345678" }
}

### Move a transfer forward (back office)
POST {{host}}/transfers/<transfer-id>/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{ "status": "Funded", "note": "Cash received at branch" }

### Treasury pushes a new rate
PUT {{host}}/rates/KWD/INR
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{ "rate": 286.10 }
